OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain, with brisk winds,
OL,6,Faffecting western Scotland and
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland will move across the
OL,8,Fremainder of Scotland, northern
OL,9,FEngland and Wales during the day,
OL,10,Fturning showery in the northwest
OL,11,Flater. Brighter further southeast,
OL,12,Fthough clouding over with patchy rain
OL,13,Fdeveloping.
OL,14,
OL,15,CTonight:FRain clearing from England
OL,16,Fand Wales overnight, to leave clear
OL,17,Fspells across the UK. Some showers,
OL,18,Fmainly in the west and northwest.
OL,19,FBreezy in the north, and locally
OL,20,Fchilly here.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
