OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FSome showers, mainly in the
OL,6,Fmorning across some northern and
OL,7,Fwestern areas. Otherwise Friday looks
OL,8,Ffine with sunny spells. Feeling
OL,9,Fpleasantly warm in the south, but
OL,10,Fremaining breezy further north.
